 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Last time\u2026 Juno vanished.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.775,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the red door",
   "start": 2.925,
   "end": 4.572,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "opened.",
   "start": 4.572,
   "end": 5.293,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone in the lobby",
   "start": 5.693,
   "end": 7.682,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "ran.",
   "start": 7.682,
   "end": 8.061,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone\u2026 except Milo.",
   "start": 8.861,
   "end": 11.293,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm not leaving without",
   "start": 11.643,
   "end": 12.788,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "her.",
   "start": 12.788,
   "end": 12.987,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "Stop. Nobody who goes",
   "start": 13.687,
   "end": 15.401,
   "spk": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "in there\u2026 ever comes",
   "start": 15.401,
   "end": 17.033,
   "spk": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "back.",
   "start": 17.033,
   "end": 17.441,
   "spk": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then why does the",
   "start": 17.741,
   "end": 18.686,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "door even exist?",
   "start": 18.686,
   "end": 19.576,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "The admin didn't answer.",
   "start": 20.076,
   "end": 22.209,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "So Milo stepped into",
   "start": 22.709,
   "end": 24.403,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the red light.",
   "start": 24.403,
   "end": 25.589,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "It was the same",
   "start": 27.189,
   "end": 28.484,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "lobby. Same floor. Same",
   "start": 28.484,
   "end": 30.47,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "door.",
   "start": 30.47,
   "end": 30.901,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "But everything\u2026 was wrong.",
   "start": 31.201,
   "end": 33.505,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "On the floor lay",
   "start": 34.405,
   "end": 35.818,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "dozens of name tags.",
   "start": 35.818,
   "end": 37.584,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Players who had vanished\u2026",
   "start": 37.784,
   "end": 39.917,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "years ago.",
   "start": 39.917,
   "end": 40.771,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the newest one",
   "start": 41.071,
   "end": 42.59,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "said\u2026",
   "start": 42.59,
   "end": 43.012,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Milo! Over here!",
   "start": 44.712,
   "end": 46.269,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno was trapped inside",
   "start": 46.569,
   "end": 48.498,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "a block of red",
   "start": 48.498,
   "end": 49.672,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "glass.",
   "start": 49.672,
   "end": 50.175,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "You shouldn't have come!",
   "start": 50.475,
   "end": 52.032,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then something stepped out",
   "start": 52.632,
   "end": 54.521,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "of the fog.",
   "start": 54.521,
   "end": 55.32,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every time the door",
   "start": 55.92,
   "end": 58.055,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "opens\u2026 someone must stay.",
   "start": 58.055,
   "end": 60.865,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "One of you leaves.",
   "start": 61.265,
   "end": 63.063,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "One of you stays.",
   "start": 63.063,
   "end": 64.761,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "Forever.",
   "start": 64.761,
   "end": 65.559,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "Milo, don't\u2026",
   "start": 66.359,
   "end": 68.13,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "Let her go. I'll",
   "start": 68.43,
   "end": 69.454,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "stay.",
   "start": 69.454,
   "end": 69.774,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "He didn't even hesitate.",
   "start": 70.174,
   "end": 72.201,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno woke up in",
   "start": 74.401,
   "end": 75.911,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the lobby.",
   "start": 75.911,
   "end": 76.918,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The door was closed.",
   "start": 77.218,
   "end": 78.892,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And Milo\u2026 was gone.",
   "start": 78.892,
   "end": 80.482,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "But on the sign,",
   "start": 81.382,
   "end": 82.541,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "someone had scratched a",
   "start": 82.541,
   "end": 84.207,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "new rule.",
   "start": 84.207,
   "end": 84.859,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Welcome back, Juno.",
   "start": 88.359,
   "end": 90.978,
   "spk": "AK"
  }
 ],
